<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SPX Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SPX Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs started coverage of SPX Corp and added the stock to the firm's recommended list, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 7/8 to 30-5/8 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
